            <div xml:id="d1240">

                <pb facs="1174" n="1162" xml:id="pg1162"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.3332/98: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-06-20T17:00:00-03:00">June 20, 1940—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 20—4:51 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>294. For Under Secretary. Department’s telegram No. 175, June 19, noon. I suggest
                    a 3–day informal visit to Recife.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
